    "body": "Thanks @domenic . Didn't realize this was part of a larger issue regarding email address syntax versus what's supported in which situations (ICANN, localhost, etc). Given the information you provided, the existing regex makes sense as a basic foundation for widespread universal application. \r\n\r\nIndividual organizations would need to determine if they need something more strict.",
